      <h1>Linxira OS</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Arch Linux for scientific computing</p>
      <p class="en-tagline">Desktop Supercomputer · Direct Arch · Built for researchers</p>
      <p class="hero-desc">A personal scientific workstation distribution built on <strong>Arch Linux</strong> — a ready-to-use <strong>KDE Plasma</strong> desktop, <strong>93 curated applications</strong>, <strong>dual-kernel + snapshot</strong> safety for rolling updates, and <strong>containerized reproducibility</strong> for research workflows. Built for scientists and developers: a computer for everyday use that doubles as a compute machine on demand.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="/en/docs/" class="cta">Get Started</a>
        <a href="/en/docs/ecosystem/" class="cta-ghost">Browse Ecosystem →</a>
